# fixedbugs, defect 2458, lane b30-shadow, 2026-11-10 (panel 244's R4).
#
# A fetched package's float constant is refused, never run (panel 235's C5),
# and the refusal's note sent the consumer to write the value in the
# package's header, a tree held to its fingerprint and no remedy for a float.
# What the note now asks of the package's author is this: the value returned
# by a `static inline` of a header the package ships, bound as a `function`,
# which a fetched build reads with nothing run. It builds and reads 0.5.
use <pk>/pk

function main()
    print(pk.half())
